#: ../../source/docs/common-do-return-path-start.rst:5
#: 90394397234e43f4a56e91851b9dc37c
msgid "Using DO_RETURN_PATH_START Mission Command"
msgstr "使用DO_RETURN_PATH_START任务命令"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-return-path-start.rst:7
#: 7599b4e0fd1b4290a2ee59e51fc73ca8
msgid ""
"While the :ref:`DO_LAND_START <common-do-land-start>` mission command "
"provides a means of defining a \"landing sequence\" that can be directly "
"jumped to for autolandings or failsafe actions, in some cases this direct "
"path might result in breaching fences or flying into obstacles."
msgstr ""
":ref:`DO_LAND_START <common-do-land-start>` "
"任务命令提供了一种定义「着陆序列」的方式，可直接跳转用于自动着陆或失控保护动作，但在某些情况下，这种直接路径可能导致突破电子围栏或飞入障碍物。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-return-path-start.rst:9
#: 0372cb13420f4f16823d5b85709ea2a2
msgid ""
"The DO_RETURN_PATH_START mission command can be used to mark a place or "
"places in the mission sequence, before the :ref:`DO_LAND_START <common-do-"
"land-start>`, that the vehicle should directly rejoin the mission path at "
"the closet point on the mission leading toward the :ref:`DO_LAND_START "
"<common-do-land-start>` sequence, rather than directly to the "
":ref:`DO_LAND_START <common-do-land-start>`. As shown below:"
msgstr ""
"DO_RETURN_PATH_START任务命令可用于在 :ref:`DO_LAND_START <common-do-land-start>` "
"之前的任务序列中标记一个或多个位置，飞行器将在任务路径上距该点最近的位置重新汇入任务，沿路径飞向 :ref:`DO_LAND_START "
"<common-do-land-start>` 序列，而不是直接飞向 :ref:`DO_LAND_START <common-do-land-"
"start>`。如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-return-path-start.rst:14
#: de65add8eb2e4380a299aab22661b160
msgid ""
"Imagine above that the vehicle takes off, flies to WP2 and 3, and if one "
"were to fly up and look at the lake but then have a failsafe, the vehicle "
"would fly directly back to the DO_LAND_START tag, crashing thru the tree, "
"exclusion fence, etc. But if a DO_RETURN_PATH_START mission item is inserted"
" after WP 3, then the vehicle would return to the mission path, proceed to "
"the waypoint after the DO_LAND_START tag and LAND safely."
msgstr ""
"想象上图中飞行器起飞，飞往WP2和WP3，如果飞到湖上方查看但随后触发失控保护，飞行器将直接飞回DO_LAND_START标记，穿越树木、排除围栏等。但如果在WP3之后插入DO_RETURN_PATH_START任务项，飞行器将返回任务路径，继续前往DO_LAND_START标记后的航点并安全降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-return-path-start.rst:16
#: b67c18edd4304293ae525ea79f76328f
msgid ""
"Multiple DO_RETURN_PATH_START items can be placed in the mission sequence to"
" tailor the return. It is not necessary that the sequence include a "
":ref:`DO_LAND_START <common-do-land-start>`, but if it does, the return to "
"the mission will occur after the DO_RETURN_PATH_START mission command but "
"before the :ref:`DO_LAND_START <common-do-land-start>`."
msgstr ""
"任务序列中可放置多个DO_RETURN_PATH_START项目以定制返航路径。序列中不必包含 :ref:`DO_LAND_START <common-"
"do-land-"
"start>`，但若包含，则返回任务的位置将在DO_RETURN_PATH_START任务命令之后、:ref:`DO_LAND_START "
"<common-do-land-start>` 之前。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-return-path-start.rst:19
#: 5c3a7786b2074f3bb14d30d698b3745c
msgid "In Plane, set :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` to 4 to use this."
msgstr "在 Plane 中，将 :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` 设置为 4 以使用此功能。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "In Copter, set any failsafe action to DO_LAND_START, whether or not one "
#~ "exists in the mission."
#~ msgstr "在Copter中，将任意失控保护动作设置为DO_LAND_START，无论任务中是否存在该项。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "if a DO_LAND_START or DO_RETURN_PATH_START does not exist in the mission, "
#~ "RTL will occur."
#~ msgstr "若任务中不存在DO_LAND_START或DO_RETURN_PATH_START，将执行RTL。"
